<title>CANADA: Morrison, Northstar in merger.</title>
<headline>Morrison, Northstar in merger.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Petroleums Ltd and Northstar Energy Corp said on Thursday they struck a merger deal.</p>
<p>Details of the proposal, which came on the heels of a failed hostile takeover attempt for Morrison by Canadian 88 Energy Corp, were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The companies said a news release would be issued shortly. Both stocks were halted.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
